  "caseId": "case19",
  "description": "The statelessness case. EIBCALEN is 0 at app/cbl/COUSR01C.cbl:78, so the MOVE DFHCOMMAREA(1:EIBCALEN) at :82 is never reached and there is nothing whatsoever on the server to fall back on: the program moves 'COSGN00C' into CDEMO-TO-PROGRAM at :79 and transfers. The payload here carries no commarea and no map field, which is the same input a caller with no conversation at all presents, and the ENTIRE observable answer is the response - which is the point. Every one of the sixteen CARDDEMO-COMMAREA fields is pinned at its declared width and takes its value from WORKING-STORAGE's initial state, spaces for each alphanumeric span and zeros for each PIC 9 span, with only the three fields :170-174 writes set. Because CDEMO-TO-PROGRAM is already 'COSGN00C' the blank-target fallback at :167-169 is a no-op rather than the thing that supplied the value. No send, no message, no write, and no HttpSession anywhere in the path: conversation state travels in the payload.",
